# soc-lab local detection rules: port scan + RDP probing
alert tcp any any -> any any (msg:"SOC-LAB Port scan - many SYN packets"; flags:S; threshold: type both, track by_src, count 15, seconds 5; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9000001; rev:1;)
alert tcp any any -> any 3389 (msg:"SOC-LAB RDP probe detected"; flags:S; classtype:attempted-recon; sid:9000002; rev:1;)